  "description": "A generation-1 resource event, generation-2 atomic replacement, exact committed-record re-feed, lower-generation next-event candidate, same-LSN sibling re-feed, failed replacement fold, and terminal candidates distinguish whole-prefix idempotence from new-event corruption while preserving rejected state atomically.",
  "input": {
