  "invariant_check": "IdempotentLogReplay: re-feeding an exact committed record already covered by the resource projection's contiguous authority-domain prefix is a whole-event no-op before generation checks; a lower generation at the next LSN is corruption, and a structurally valid replacement whose tombstone can apply before its paired upsert fails leaves the cursor, resources, views, and durable prefix unchanged."
